  m_text: "<color=#FFFF22><size=22><b>[ How To Use? ]</b></size></color>\r\n1. Add
    an <color=#40A0FF><b>ARS Controller</b></color> to your scene.\r\n2. Assign an
    AudioSource to the controller.\r\n3. <indent=20>Assign an ARS-compatible material
    or shader to any mesh.</indent>\r\n4. Assign any ARS effect to objects  \r\n  
    \u2022 ARSTransform, ARSLight, ARSParticleBurst, etc.\r\n\r\n<color=#FFFF22><size=22><b>[
    What Can I Do With It? ]</b></size></color>\r\n\u2022 Control multiple shaders
    with <color=#40A0FF><b>ARS Shaders</b></color>.  \r\n\u2022 Use <color=#40A0FF><b>ARS
    Channels</b></color> to control non-shader effects."
